        },
        {
          "text": "A doŋ Lakana ceggi cobo ticcere, okobo ni, ‘Kara wun itamo wunu ni an ŋa? An gira mom a dano-nono. Pe gire, ento ŋattoro tye ame abino i ŋea ame an mom aromo gonyo amuk i tyene.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
